OL,3,AUS orders some diplomats to leave Saudi
OL,4,AArabia as Houthi attacks escalate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US State Department has ordered
OL,7,Fsome diplomats and their families to
OL,8,Fleave Saudi Arabia as attacks escalate,
OL,9,Fwith three people killed in strikes
OL,10,Facross the country.
OL,12,FSaudi authorities said debris from a
OL,13,Fdrone intercepted during an attempted
OL,14,Fattack on an oil field killed two
OL,15,Fpeople, while one person died after a
OL,16,Fstrike at the King Fahd International
OL,17,FAirport in Dammam.
OL,19,FConflict between Yemen's Iran-backed
OL,20,FHouthis and Saudi Arabia has been
OL,21,Frising in the past month.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
