OL,3,AUS orders some diplomats to leave Saudi
OL,4,AArabia as Houthi attacks escalate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Houthis have responded to Saudi
OL,7,Fstrikes by launching missiles and
OL,8,Fdrones at airports, energy facilities
OL,9,Fand military bases in Saudi Arabia. A
OL,10,Frecent strike on Riyadh's international
OL,11,Fairport was the deadliest in the
OL,12,Fkingdom in years.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
